# Theorix Charm's second mode: "Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn." Llanowar Elves (1/1) becomes -1/-1 and
# dies as a state-based action (CR 704.5f). Only a creature can be targeted: Bot2's Mox Ruby is refused.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Theorix Charm
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Ruby
Llanowar Elves
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
